<title>USA: Benchmark applies for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Benchmark applies for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>ANGLETON, Texas 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benchmark Electronics Inc said it has applied to list its stock on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE).</p>
<p>The company anticipates that its shares will begin trading on the NYSE in May of 1997 under the symbol &quot;BHE&quot;.  There are currently approximately 5.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Benchmark Electronics provides contract manufacturing and engineering services to original equipment manufacturers.</p>
</text>
